{
  "id": "unique-event-011",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#11 - into the sewers\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,231,253]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This section of the sewers is used\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,253,288]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "by survivors as a shelter. There is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,288,324]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rudimentary comfort and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,324,348]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "defenses. If you want to convince\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,348,382]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the survivors to let you in, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,382,415]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "must give them one of your items\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,415,448]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or 2 Food points and succeed a L4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,448,482]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma roll. Roll at +1 if you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,482,520]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma, at +2 if you Charisma\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,520,552]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(Expert). If you fail, they will not let\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,552,593]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you in and there is a 2 in 6 chance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,593,629]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that you will be attacked by a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,629,660]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "horde of sewer rats.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,660,681]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sewer rat horde, L2 animal, 5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,681,711]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life, damage 1. Treat as a single\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,711,745]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creature. Once the horde is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,745,773]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "reduced to 2 Life or lower, you get\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,773,809]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+1 to your Defense rolls until the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,809,844]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "end of the combat. If you have a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,844,877]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "dose of rat poison, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,877,905]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "discard 1 Food and the rat poison\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,905,939]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to automatically inflict 2 damage\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,939,973]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to the horde.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,973,987]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You get a -1 on Attack rolls if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,987,1023]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attack the horde with ranged\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1023,1052]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapons, except for a shotgun\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1052,1082]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "which hits them at an additional\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1082,1115]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+1 instead.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1115,1127]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If the survivor lets you in, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1127,1164]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "consider this area a Safe House as\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1164,1199]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "long as you “pay” at least 1 Food\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1199,1233]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "point every time you enter it. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1233,1271]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "do not pay, roll again a 2 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1271,1303]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of an encounter with  the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1303,1336]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rats, and the area will no longer\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1336,1370]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-011:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "count as a Safe House.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1370,1393]]"
    }
  ],
